      "template": "welcome_catalog",
      "body": "Hi {{name}},\n\nWelcome! I'm Bob Mills, and I'm thrilled to have you here.\n\nWhether you're discovering the No Blue Sky series for the first time or you've heard about it through fellow readers, you're in for a journey. I've poured years of imagination, research, and heart into these stories — and I'm so glad you're giving them a chance.\n\nHere's a look at what's available:\n\n📚 THE NO BLUE SKY SERIES (5 Volumes)\nA gripping science fiction saga that explores what happens when humanity reaches beyond the stars — and finds more questions than answers.\n\nVolume 1: No Blue Sky: Ignition — $9.99\nVolume 2: No Blue Sky: Ascent — $11.99\nVolume 3: No Blue Sky: Orbit — $12.99\nVolume 4: No Blue Sky: Horizon — $14.99\nVolume 5: No Blue Sky: Beyond — $14.99\n\n📖 STANDALONE TITLE\nTomorrow is Still Open — $19.99\nA powerful standalone story about second chances, resilience, and the doors that open when you least expect them.\n\nAll books are available individually, and if you're buying for a group — book club, classroom, or team — I offer special bulk pricing:\n\n• 10–49 copies: 10% off\n• 50–199 copies: 20% off\n• 200–999 copies: 30% off\n• 1,000+ copies: 40% off\n\nReply to this email anytime if you have questions about the books, want signed copies, or need help choosing where to start. I read every message personally.\n\nHappy reading,\nBob Mills\n\nP.S. — Over the next couple of weeks, I'll send you a behind-the-scenes look at the stories, early reviews, and a special offer. Keep an eye on your inbox!",
